OL,3,GNEWSATown's postal delays 'slowly
OL,4,Aimproving,' MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has said there is some hope for
OL,7,Fresidents experiencing postal delays
OL,8,Fafter he made a surprise visit to the
OL,9,Ftown's sorting office.
OL,11,FCameron Thomas, MP for Tewkesbury,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, said he could
OL,13,F"absolutely see why people are not
OL,14,Fgetting their mail on time" after
OL,15,Fvisiting the office on 21 October, but
OL,16,Fadded that things appeared to be
OL,17,F"slowly improving".
OL,19,FResidents in the town have been
OL,20,Fcomplaining about delays, with some
OL,21,Fsaying it has taken up to three weeks
OL,22,Ffor letters and parcels to arrive.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
