OL,3,GNEWSATown's postal delays 'slowly
OL,4,Aimproving,' MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Royal Mail said: "We
OL,7,Fknow there is more to do, including in
OL,8,FTewkesbury. Our colleagues are working
OL,9,Fhard to provide customers with a
OL,10,Freliable and consistent service."
